## Main Technology Stack

| Layer               | Technology                                            |
| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| Operating system    | Linux, preferably Ubuntu or Kali Linux                |
| Wireless capture    | Monitor-mode Wi-Fi adapter                            |
| Packet capture      | TShark and PyShark                                    |
| Packet processing   | Python                                                |
| Packet parsing      | PyShark IEEE 802.11 fields                            |
| Feature extraction  | Python classes and time-window counters               |
| Detection engine    | Python rule-based modules                             |
| Alert correlation   | Python correlation service                            |
| Backend API         | Flask                                                 |
| API structure       | Flask Blueprints                                      |
| Input validation    | Marshmallow or Pydantic                               |
| Database ORM        | SQLAlchemy                                            |
| Database migrations | Flask-Migrate and Alembic                             |
| Database            | SQLite for Version 1                                  |
| Authentication      | Flask-JWT-Extended                                    |
| Cross-origin access | Flask-CORS                                            |
| Logging             | Python `logging` with rotating file handlers          |
| Real-time updates   | Flask-SocketIO or dashboard polling                   |
| Frontend            | React                                                 |
| Frontend API client | Axios or Fetch API                                    |
| Testing             | Pytest for Python and React Testing Library for React |
